#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:10002
msgid "解读 `StructuralEqual`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:10004
msgid "源码：`tvm/node/structural_equal.h`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:20002
msgid "`BaseValueEqual`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30002
msgid ""
"`BaseValueEqual` 类，用于比较不同类型的基本值是否相等。该类包含多个重载的 `operator()` "
"函数，分别用于比较不同类型的参数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30004
msgid "具体来说，该类实现了以下类型的比较："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30005
msgid "对于 `double` 类型，使用模糊浮点数比较，允许一定的误差范围（1e-9）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30006
msgid "对于 `int64_t`、`uint64_t`、`int` 和 `bool` 类型，直接使用等于运算符进行比较。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30007
msgid "对于 `std::string` 类型，也使用等于运算符进行比较。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30008
msgid "对于 `DataType` 类型，同样使用等于运算符进行比较。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30009
msgid "对于枚举类型，也使用等于运算符进行比较。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:30011
msgid "通过这些重载的 `operator()` 函数，可以方便地对不同类型的基本值进行相等性判断。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:40002
msgid "`ObjectPathPairNode` 和 `ObjectPathPair`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:40027
msgid ""
"`ObjectPathPairNode` 继承自 `Object` "
"类，它表示两个对象路径的对（`pair`），用于测试这两个对象的结构相等性。该类包含两个成员变量 `lhs_path` 和 "
"`rhs_path`，分别表示左操作数和右操作数的对象路径。构造函数接受两个 `ObjectPath` "
"类型的参数，用于初始化这两个成员变量。此外，该类还定义了静态常量字符串 `_type_key`，用于标识该类的类型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:40029
msgid ""
"`ObjectPathPair` 继承自 `ObjectRef` 类，它表示指向 `ObjectPathPairNode` "
"对象的引用。该类包含构造函数，接受两个 `ObjectPath` 类型的参数，用于创建 `ObjectPathPairNode` "
"对象，并将其封装为 `ObjectRef` 类型。此外，该类还定义了一些方法，用于操作 `ObjectPathPairNode` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:50002
msgid "`StructuralEqual`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60002
msgid "`StructuralEqual` 类，继承自 `BaseValueEqual` 类。该类用于比较两个对象是否在结构上相等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60004
msgid "结构相等性是通过 IR 节点的 DAG 递归定义的，有两种类型的节点："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60005
msgid "图节点：在 `lhs` 中的图节点只能映射为 `rhs` 中的一个且仅有一个图节点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60006
msgid "普通节点：在没有图节点限制的情况下递归定义相等性。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60008
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Vars(tir::Var, TypeVar)` 和非常量 relay 表达式节点是图节点。例如，这意味着在 relay 中，`%1 = %x "
"+ %y; %1 + %1` 不能被结构地等于 `%1 = %x + %y; %2 = %x + %y; %1 + %2`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60010
msgid "如果满足以下条件之一，则可以将类型相同的 `var` 映射为相等："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60011
#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110014
msgid "它们出现在相同的定义点（例如函数参数）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60012
#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110015
msgid "它们通过相同的关系指向相同的 `VarNode`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60013
msgid "它们出现在相同的使用点，并且将 `map_free_vars` 设置为 `True`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:60015
msgid ""
"该类还重载了 `operator()` 方法，用于比较两个对象是否在结构上相等。该方法接受三个参数：左操作数、右操作数和布尔值 "
"`map_free_params`，表示是否映射自由变量。返回值为比较结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:70002
msgid "`SEqualReducer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:70255
msgid ""
"`SEqualReducer` 类，它是结构相等性结果的规约器。这个类的主要目的是通过调用每个对象的 `SEqualReduce` "
"函数来递归地比较两个对象是否相等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:70257
msgid ""
"`SEqualReducer` 类包含内部处理器 `Handler`，它定义了一些自定义行为的方法，如 "
"`SEqualReduce`、`DeferFail`、`IsFailDeferralEnabled`、`MapLhsToRhs` 和 "
"`MarkGraphNode`。这些方法需要在派生类中实现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:70259
msgid ""
"`SEqualReducer` 类还包含一些重载的运算符，用于比较不同类型的值，如 "
"`double`、`int64_t`、`uint64_t`、`int`、`bool`、`std::string`、`DataType` "
"和枚举类型。这些运算符将调用相应的比较方法，如 `EnumAttrsEqual` 或 `ObjectAttrsEqual`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:70261
msgid ""
"此外，`SEqualReducer` 类还提供了一些其他方法，如 `operator()` 重载，用于比较两个对象是否相等；`DefEqual` "
"方法，用于比较两个定义点是否相等，其中自由变量可以被映射；以及一些辅助方法，如 `IsPathTracingEnabled` 和 "
"`GetCurrentObjectPaths`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:80002
msgid "`SEqualHandlerDefault`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90003
msgid "这段代码定义了一个名为`SEqualHandlerDefault`的类，它是`SEqualReducer::Handler`类的默认处理器。这个类用于处理对象之间的相等性测试。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90005
msgid "该类具有以下成员函数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90006
msgid ""
"`SEqualHandlerDefault(bool assert_mode, Optional<ObjectPathPair>* "
"first_mismatch, bool "
"defer_fails)`：构造函数，接受三个参数：`assert_mode`表示是否使用断言模式，`first_mismatch`是一个指向可选的对象路径对的指针，`defer_fails`表示是否延迟失败。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90007
msgid "`~SEqualHandlerDefault()`：析构函数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90008
msgid ""
"`SEqualReduce(const ObjectRef& lhs, const ObjectRef& rhs, bool "
"map_free_vars, const Optional<ObjectPathPair>& "
"current_paths)`：重载的`SEqualReduce`方法，用于比较两个对象是否相等。它接受四个参数：左操作数`lhs`、右操作数`rhs`、是否映射自由变量`map_free_vars`以及当前路径对`current_paths`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90009
msgid "`DeferFail(const ObjectPathPair& mismatch_paths)`：延迟失败的方法，接受一个对象路径对作为参数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90010
msgid "`IsFailDeferralEnabled()`：检查是否启用了失败延迟。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90011
msgid "`MapLhsToRhs(const ObjectRef& lhs)`：将左操作数映射到右操作数的方法，接受一个对象引用作为参数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90012
msgid "`MarkGraphNode()`：标记图形节点的方法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90013
msgid ""
"`Equal(const ObjectRef& lhs, const ObjectRef& rhs, bool "
"map_free_vars)`：入口点方法，用于进行相等性测试。它接受三个参数：左操作数`lhs`、右操作数`rhs`以及是否映射自由变量`map_free_vars`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90014
msgid ""
"`DispatchSEqualReduce(const ObjectRef& lhs, const ObjectRef& rhs, bool "
"map_free_vars, const Optional<ObjectPathPair>& "
"current_paths)`：中间对象的相等性测试调度器方法，接受四个参数：左操作数`lhs`、右操作数`rhs`、是否映射自由变量`map_free_vars`以及当前路径对`current_paths`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:90016
msgid "此外，该类还包含一个私有成员变量`impl`，它是一个指向内部实现类的指针。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:100002
msgid "Python 接口：`structural_equal`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110002
msgid "`structural_equal` 函数，用于检查两个对象（`lhs` 和 `rhs`）在结构上是否相等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110004
msgid "该函数接受三个参数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110005
msgid "`lhs`：左操作数，表示要比较的第一个对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110006
msgid "`rhs`：右操作数，表示要比较的第二个对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110007
msgid "`map_free_vars`：布尔值，表示是否将自由变量（即没有定义  `site` 的变量）映射为相等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110009
msgid ""
"函数首先使用 `tvm.runtime.convert` 将 `lhs` 和 `rhs` 转换为相应的类型。然后，它调用 "
"`_ffi_node_api.StructuralEqual` 函数来执行实际的结构相等性检查，并将结果转换为布尔值返回。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110011
msgid ""
"该函数的实现考虑了两种类型的节点：图节点和非图节点。图节点是指那些在 `lhs` 中只能映射为与 `rhs` "
"中的一个且只有一个图节点相等的节点。非图节点则通过递归定义等价性，不受到图节点的限制。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110013
msgid "对于图节点（如 `tir::Var` 和 `TypeVar`），如果满足以下条件之一，它们可以映射为相同类型的另一个变量相等："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110016
msgid "它们出现在相同的使用点，并且 `map_free_vars` 设置为 `True`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110018
msgid "这些规则用于重新映射函数参数和 `let` 绑定中的变量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/arith/analyzer/StructuralEqual.ipynb:110020
msgid "最后，函数返回布尔值，表示比较的结果。"
msgstr ""

